Break apart, spin around!

133
00:26:02,910 --> 00:26:06,710
Baby Don't Stop ねぇねぇ 誰のせいかな
Baby Don't Stop, hey hey, whose fault is it?

134
00:26:12,610 --> 00:26:16,110
