153
00:28:33,190 --> 00:28:36,390
鳴り響いた
Resounding out.

154
00:28:36,690 --> 00:28:41,290
大人ってなんだろう わかんないや
What does it mean to be an adult? I don't get it at all.

155
00:28:41,590 --> 00:28:45,990
